# =================================================================
data/
dashboard/public/data/

# Monthly Usage Report CSV exports staged locally for 'npm run report:import'
# (real billing/usage data with PII; must never be committed to main).
# Intentionally NOT root-anchored: 'npm run report:import' examples stage files
# under subdirectories too (e.g. ./downloads/copilot-usage-2026-08.csv), so these
# patterns must match at any depth.
AIUsageReport*.csv
*usage_report*.csv
*usage-report*.csv
# Any filename ending in a 6-digit YYYYMM before .csv (e.g. foo_202608.csv)
*[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].csv
# Any filename ending in a hyphenated YYYY-MM before .csv (e.g. copilot-usage-2026-08.csv)
*[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].csv

# =================================================================
# Data Storage (Stored only in GitHub Variables, not in any branches)
# Ad-hoc local working directories/exports for sensitive PII inputs
# (e.g. raw org/enterprise member exports staged before mapping generation)
# =================================================================
_sensitivity-data/
*user*list*.csv

